# Everything in this branch is read inside a Linux container.
#
# Checked out on Windows, git turns `#!/bin/sh` into `#!/bin/sh\r`, and the
# kernel then looks for an interpreter literally named `/bin/sh\r`. The
# container exits immediately with
#
#     exec /usr/local/bin/comodor-start: no such file or directory
#
# which names a file that is plainly there, on the one command this whole
# branch exists to make work. Nothing here is ever edited by a Windows tool
# that needs CRLF, so the working tree keeps LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
